Package: plasma-fusion
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         plasma-workspace (>= 4:6.7),
         plasma-desktop (>= 4:6.7),
         kwin-wayland (>= 4:6.7),
         ${layershell:Depends},
         breeze-icon-theme,
         libkf6config-bin,
         pkexec,
         python3,
         python3-pil,
         systemd,
         librsvg2-bin | python3-pyside6.qtsvg
Recommends: plasma-fusion-decoration, plasma-fusion-settings, libnotify-bin, powerdevil, plasma-nm,
            plasma-pa, bluedevil
Suggests: plasma-fusion-navigation, xournalpp, kate, konsole, python3-pyside6.qtsvg
Description: Plasma Fusion desktop for KDE Plasma 6 (themes, widgets, icons, fonts)
 Plasma Fusion is a desktop for KDE Plasma 6 in a dark and a light variant:
 Global Themes with the desktop layout and splash screen, color schemes, Plasma
 styles, icon and cursor themes, window decorations, wallpapers, a top bar,
 launcher, dock and quick-settings widgets, a window switcher and KWin scripts,
 a lock-screen shell, Konsole and Kate color themes and the Manrope and Space
 Grotesk fonts.
 .
 Each user then runs "plasma-fusion setup" inside their Plasma session, and
 "plasma-fusion update" after later updates.

Package: plasma-fusion-decoration
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, plasma-fusion (>= ${source:Upstream-Version})
Enhances: kwin-wayland
Description: Plasma Fusion window decoration for KWin
 The Plasma Fusion window decoration: a tall title bar with the app icon and a
 left-aligned title, round buttons, rounded corners with the window content
 clipped, a thin light edge and soft shadows. In tablet mode the title bar and
 its buttons grow to touch size.

Package: plasma-fusion-settings
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, plasma-fusion (>= ${source:Upstream-Version}),
         systemsettings, qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami, qml6-module-org-kde-kcmutils
Description: Plasma Fusion settings page for System Settings
 The Appearance page of the Plasma Fusion desktop as a System Settings module:
 light, dark or automatic style, the accent color, the window-button layout,
 dock magnification, the global menu, snap layouts, the glass level, high
 contrast, reduced motion, tablet mode and two ways to start over.

Package: plasma-fusion-navigation
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, plasma-fusion (>= ${source:Upstream-Version}), ${kwin:Depends}
Enhances: kwin-wayland
Description: Plasma Fusion tablet navigation gestures (KWin effect)
 In tablet posture: swipe up from the bottom edge to go home, swipe up a little
 for the dock, swipe up and hold for the app switcher, or swipe along the bottom
 edge for the previous app. Built against one KWin release series; it is
 rebuilt for each.
